  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nIf you restart synaspe quite some clients who are currently connected will get \"session timed out\" or \"you were logged out for security reasons\". This is.....rather bad :/ Using synapse 1.15.1\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- restart synapse\r\n- get logged out of connected clients\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Homeserver**: sorunome.de\r\n\r\n- **Version**: 1.15.1\r\n\r\n- **Install method**: provided debian repos\r\n\r\n- **Platform**: debian\r\n",
